  "name": "Custom UI Fonts",
  "slug": "custom-ui-fonts",
  "teaser": "Swapping the in-game UI font to a custom font",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/L5vVDT6NKwzaO2QnNYFFnSIHt3wtAmK63C31mAPA.png",
  "downloads": 219,
  "favourites_count": 3,
  "description": "<h1>Custom UI Fonts</h1>\n<p><strong>Swap your in-game UI font with a custom font</strong>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/v3byv2J.gif\" alt=\"gif\" /></p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Known Bugs</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Some Fonts might not fit properly on certain UI elements</li>\n<li>Some UI elements (example “Item ShortName” disappear when having a specific font selected (example: gg sans Bold)</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Features</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Change your UI font instantly from F12 menu</li>\n<li>No game restart required when switching fonts</li>\n<li>Includes a growing library of custom fonts</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Planned Features</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Global Font Scale Slider for Both Vanilla Fonts &amp; Custom Fonts</li>\n<li>Addtional Fonts, Please request some :3</li>\n<li>Text Style / Weight Toggles -  extra bolding, letter spacing, or line height adjustments</li>\n<li>More</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Special thanks to:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/116307/saga\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Saga</a> for fine-tuning code and helping with questions</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/4843/terkoiz\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Terkoiz</a> for Thumbnail &amp; Mentoring</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Included Fonts &amp; Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Version 1.0 includes the following fonts:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://font.download/font/borda\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Borda Demi Bold</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.dafont.com/cheese-milky.font\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Cheese Milky</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://font.download/font/choco-cooky\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Choco Cooky</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/jesusmgg/comic-shanns-mono\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Comic Shanns Mono Regular</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://font.download/font/friz-quadrata\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Friz Quadrata Regular</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://font.download/font/gg-sans-2\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">gg sans Bold</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://font.download/font/gillsanswgl\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">GillSansWGL</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://font.download/font/impact\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Impact</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.dafont.com/minecraft.font\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Minecraft</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://font.download/font/motiva-sans\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Motiva Sans Black &amp; Bold</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Play\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Play Bold</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://fonts.adobe.com/fonts/purista\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Puristratial Bold</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.dafont.com/super-mario-256.font\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Super Mario</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.dafont.com/the-wild-breath-of-zelda.font\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">The Wild Breath of Zelda</a></li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-6\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Support/Requests</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Found a bug or have an font request?</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Bug Reports:</strong> Please open an issue on the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/hjal-dev/Custom-UI-Fonts/issues\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">GitHub Issues</a> page</li>\n<li><strong>Feature Requests:</strong> Feel free to suggest new features or request additional fonts</li>\n<li><strong>Please avoid posting log files in Forge comments.</strong> GitHub Issues make it much easier to troubleshoot problems</li>\n</ul></div></div></div>\n",
